<title>USA: Emerson Electric to buy back 20 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Emerson Electric to buy back 20 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emerson Electric Co said Tuesday its directors authorized the repurchase of up to 20 million, or about nine percent, of the company's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Emerson said it plans to buy back the shares over the next four to five years.</p>
<p>Emerson, with more than 220 million shares outstanding, designs, makes electrical and electronic products and systems.</p>
<p>	   Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
